<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: Irish NTMA to auction 75 mln punts of 20-yr bond.</title>
<headline>Irish NTMA to auction 75 mln punts of 20-yr bond.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ireland's National Treasury Management Agency (NTMA) said on Monday that it would hold a competitive auction of 75 million punts of the 8.25 percent bond due 2015 at 1000 GMT (1100 local time) on September 10.  </p>
<p>The NTMA said it would also hold a non-competitive auction confined to primary dealers for up to 22.5 million punts of the 20-year bond.</p>
<p>-- Dublin Newsroom +353 1 676 9779</p>
</text>
